{"body": [{"y0": 65.8, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 311.4, "text": "Titus: \"Decem, ündecim, duodecim, tredecim, quat-"}, {"y0": 83.8, "x0": 40.6, "x1": 311.2, "text": "20 tuordecim, quindecim, sédecim, septendecim, duodé-"}, {"y0": 101.6, "x0": 55.8, "x1": 310.6, "text": "viginti; ündéviginti, viginti, viginti ünus, viginti duo...\""}, {"y0": 120.9, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 311.0, "text": "Hic magister eum interpellat: \"Necesse nón est om-"}, {"y0": 138.7, "x0": 56.5, "x1": 311.2, "text": "nés numeros dicere; à viginti dic decimum:quemque"}, {"y0": 156.7, "x0": 56.5, "x1": 173.3, "text": "numerum tantum, Tite!\""}, {"y0": 174.9, "x0": 40.1, "x1": 311.0, "text": "25 Titus: \"Viginti, trigintà, quadràgintà, quinquaginta,"}, {"y0": 193.4, "x0": 56.5, "x1": 309.9, "text": "sexagintà, septuàágintà, octogintà, nónàgintà, centum.\""}, {"y0": 211.8, "x0": 67.3, "x1": 311.0, "text": "Magister: ^Bene numeràs, Tite. Iam tü, Sexte, dic"}, {"y0": 229.8, "x0": 56.3, "x1": 192.4, "text": "numeros à centum ad mille!\""}, {"y0": 247.6, "x0": 67.6, "x1": 264.6, "text": "Sextus: ^Longum est tot numeros dicere!\""}, {"y0": 265.6, "x0": 40.1, "x1": 310.8, "text": "30 — Magister: \"At satis est decem numeros dicere, id est"}, {"y0": 284.3, "x0": 56.1, "x1": 166.6, "text": "centesimum quemque.\""}, {"y0": 302.1, "x0": 67.3, "x1": 310.5, "text": "Sextus: \"Centum, ducenti, trecenti, quadringenti,"}, {"y0": 320.5, "x0": 55.9, "x1": 310.3, "text": "quingenti, sescenti, septingenti, octingenti, nongenti,"}, {"y0": 338.5, "x0": 55.9, "x1": 87.3, "text": "mille.\""}, {"y0": 356.3, "x0": 39.9, "x1": 258.3, "text": "35 X Magister: \"Quot sunt triginta et decem?\""}, {"y0": 374.9, "x0": 66.7, "x1": 310.3, "text": "Omnes pueri simul respondent, nemó eórum manum"}, {"y0": 393.2, "x0": 55.8, "x1": 310.3, "text": "tollit. Titus et Sextus ünó ore dicunt: \"Quadraginta.\""}, {"y0": 411.2, "x0": 55.6, "x1": 310.1, "text": "Marcus véro dicit: \"Quinquaginta.\" Quod Marcus dicit"}, {"y0": 429.8, "x0": 55.8, "x1": 310.5, "text": "réctum non est. Responsum Titi et Sexti réctum est: ii"}, {"y0": 447.9, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 309.9, "text": "40 récté respondent. Responsum Marci est pravum: is"}, {"y0": 466.1, "x0": 55.4, "x1": 132.4, "text": "pràávé respondet."}, {"y0": 483.9, "x0": 39.0, "x1": 309.9, "text": "Il Magister Titum et Sextum laudat: \"Vos récté respon-"}, {"y0": 502.1, "x0": 55.0, "x1": 310.1, "text": "détis, Tite et Sexte. Discipuli prüdentés atque industrii"}, {"y0": 520.5, "x0": 55.0, "x1": 309.7, "text": "estis.\" Deinde Màrcum interrogat: *Quot sunt trigintà"}, {"y0": 538.8, "x0": 39.0, "x1": 109.2, "text": "45 et septem?\""}], "margin": [{"y0": 67.4, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 370.4, "text": "X decem"}, {"y0": 76.6, "x0": 324.8, "x1": 381.0, "text": "XI  ün-decim"}, {"y0": 85.6, "x0": 325.0, "x1": 385.1, "text": "XII  duo-decim"}, {"y0": 95.0, "x0": 324.8, "x1": 381.2, "text": "XIII tré-decim"}, {"y0": 104.1, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 402.1, "text": "XIV  quattuor-decim"}, {"y0": 113.3, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 387.7, "text": "XV  quin-decim"}, {"y0": 122.3, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 378.3, "text": "XVI  sé-decim"}, {"y0": 131.5, "x0": 324.7, "x1": 394.1, "text": "XVII septen-decim"}, {"y0": 140.3, "x0": 324.5, "x1": 397.6, "text": "XVIII. duo-de-viginti"}, {"y0": 149.5, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 393.2, "text": "XIX  ün-dé-viginü"}, {"y0": 158.7, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 369.7, "text": "XX viginti"}, {"y0": 167.7, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 372.7, "text": "XXX trigintà"}, {"y0": 176.7, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 389.1, "text": "XL .quadràgintà"}, {"y0": 186.2, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 393.8, "text": "L quinquágintà"}, {"y0": 195.2, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 379.4, "text": "LX  Ssexagintà"}, {"y0": 204.6, "x0": 324.3, "x1": 386.9, "text": "LXX septuaginta"}, {"y0": 213.6, "x0": 324.1, "x1": 379.0, "text": "LXXX octógintà"}, {"y0": 222.6, "x0": 323.9, "x1": 381.5, "text": "XC  nónàágintà"}, {"y0": 232.8, "x0": 324.1, "x1": 372.9, "text": "C centum"}, {"y0": 249.4, "x0": 324.1, "x1": 405.7, "text": "tot (?ndecl) — tam multi"}, {"y0": 260.4, "x0